{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24047","headline":"早夏游宴 · 白居易","name":"早夏游宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽慵兴犹在，虽老心犹健。\n昨日山水游，今朝花酒宴。\n山榴艳似火，玉蘂飘如霰。\n荣落逐瞬迁，炎凉随刻变。\n未收木绵褥，已动蒲葵扇。\n且喜物与人，年年得相见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}